003	LEV	009	010	Afei, ɔhyee sradeɛ, sawa, berɛboɔ, berɛboɔ nkotokuo a ɛfiri bɔne afɔrebɔdeɛ no mu sɛdeɛ Awurade hyɛɛ Mose no.
