018	JOB	015	001	Na Temanni Elifas buaa sɛ,
018	JOB	015	002	“Enti onyansafoɔ de nsɛm a aba biara nni muo bɛyi nʼano anaasɛ ɔde apueeɛ mframa a emu yɛ hye bɛhyɛ nʼafuru ma?
