018	JOB	015	013	na woadane wʼabofuo agu Onyankopɔn so na woma saa nsɛm yi pue firi wʼano?
018	JOB	015	014	“Ɔdasani ne hwan a ɔbɛtumi ayɛ pɛ, anaasɛ deɛ ɔbaa awo noɔ bɛn na ɔbɛtumi ayɛ ɔteneneeni?
018	JOB	015	015	Onyankopɔn nni ahotosoɔ wɔ nʼakronkronfoɔ mu. Ɔsorosoro mpo nnyɛ kronn wɔ nʼani so,
018	JOB	015	016	na nkantom onipa bɔnefoɔ ne omumuyɛfoɔ a ɔnom awurukasɛm sɛ nsuo.
018	JOB	015	017	“Tie me, na mɛkyerɛ wo mu; ma menka deɛ mahunu nkyerɛ wo,
