018	JOB	015	019	(wɔn a wɔde asase no maa wɔn ɛberɛ a ananafoɔ biara nni hɔ):
018	JOB	015	020	Omumuyɛfoɔ kɔ ahohiahia mu ne nkwanna nyinaa. Na basabasayɛni nso, wɔahyehyɛ ne mfeɛ nyinaa ama no.
018	JOB	015	021	Nnyegyeɛ a ɛyɛ hu hyɛ nʼasom ma; na sɛ ɛyɛ sɛ nneɛma rekɔ yie ma no a, akorɔmfoɔ to hyɛ ne so.
018	JOB	015	022	Ɔpa aba sɛ ɔbɛdwane afiri esum mu; wɔabɔ no ato hɔ ama akofena.
018	JOB	015	023	Ɔkyinkyini hwehwɛ aduane; ɔnim sɛ esum da no abɛn.
018	JOB	015	024	Ɔhaw ne ahoyera yi no hu; ɛhyɛ ne so sɛ ɔhene a wasiesie ne ho ama ɔko,
018	JOB	015	025	ɛfiri sɛ ɔtenetene ne nsa kyerɛ Onyankopɔn na ɔma ne ho so tia Otumfoɔ.
018	JOB	015	026	Wɔde akokyɛm a emu pi na ɛyɛ den kɔ ne so a wɔnsuro no.
018	JOB	015	027	“Ɛwom sɛ sradeɛ ama wɔn afono atotɔ na wɔn asene mu ɛnam agu mmɛbɛ deɛ,
