018	JOB	016	017	Nanso, me nsa nyɛɛ basabasayɛ biara na me mpaeɛbɔ yɛ kronn.
018	JOB	016	018	“Ao asase, nkata me mogya so; na mma wɔnsie me sufrɛ!
