019	PSA	107	004	Ebinom kyinkyinii wɔ nsase paradada so, a wɔanhunu ɛkwan ankɔ kuropɔn no mu, baabi a wɔbɛtumi anya atenaeɛ.
019	PSA	107	005	Ɛkɔm ne sukɔm dee wɔn na wɔtotɔɔ baha.
019	PSA	107	006	Afei wɔsu frɛɛ Awurade wɔ wɔn amanehunu mu, na ɔgyee wɔn firii wɔn ahohiahia mu.
019	PSA	107	007	Ɔde wɔn faa ɛkwan tee so baa kuropɔn a wɔtumi tena mu no mu.
019	PSA	107	008	Momma wɔnna Awurade ase, nʼadɔeɛ a ɛnsa da ho ne nʼanwanwadeɛ a ɔyɛ ma nnipa.
019	PSA	107	009	Ɔma wɔn a sukɔm de wɔn nsuo na ɔde nnepa hyɛ wɔn a ɛkɔm de wɔn ma.
019	PSA	107	010	Ebinom tenaa esum ne awerɛhoɔ mu, nneduafoɔ a wɔde dadeɛ nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn agu wɔn,
