019	PSA	122	001	Ɔsoroforɔ dwom. Dawid deɛ. Ɛberɛ a wɔsee me sɛ, “Ma yɛnkɔ Awurade fie” no, mʼani gyeeɛ.
019	PSA	122	002	Yɛgyinagyina wʼapono ano, Ao Yerusalem.
019	PSA	122	003	Wɔakyekyere Yerusalem yie sɛ kuropɔn. Wɔahyehyɛ mu nneɛma fɛfɛ.
019	PSA	122	004	Ɛhɔ na mmusuakuo no korɔ, Awurade mmusuakuo no. Wɔkɔkamfo Awurade din sɛdeɛ nhyehyɛeɛ a wɔde ama Israel no teɛ.
019	PSA	122	005	Ɛhɔ na atemmuo nhennwa no sisi, Dawid fie nhennwa no.
019	PSA	122	006	Monsrɛ asomdwoeɛ mma Yerusalem sɛ, “Ma wɔn a wɔdɔ wo no nnya banbɔ.
019	PSA	122	007	Ma asomdwoeɛ mmra wʼafasuo mu na banbɔ mmra wʼabankɛsewa mu.”
019	PSA	122	008	Me nuanom ne me nnamfonom enti, meka sɛ, “Asomdwoeɛ ntena wo mu.”
019	PSA	122	009	Awurade yɛn Onyankopɔn fie enti, mɛhwehwɛ wo nkɔsoɔ.
019	PSA	123	001	Ɔsoroforɔ dwom. Mema mʼani so kyerɛ wo, wo a wʼahennwa si ɔsoro.
019	PSA	123	002	Sɛdeɛ nkoa ani hwɛ wɔn wura nsa no, sɛdeɛ afenaa ani hwɛ nʼawurakwaa nsa no, saa ara na yɛn ani hwɛ Awurade, yɛn Onyankopɔn kɔsi sɛ ɔbɛhunu yɛn mmɔbɔ.
019	PSA	123	003	Hu yɛn mmɔbɔ, Ao Awurade, hunu yɛn mmɔbɔ, na wɔabu yɛn animtia bebree.
019	PSA	123	004	Ahomasofoɔ fɛdie ama yɛabrɛ dodo; ahantanfoɔ animtiabuo afono yɛn.
019	PSA	124	001	Ɔsoroforɔ dwom. Dawid deɛ. Sɛ anka Awurade nni yɛn afa a, ma Israel nka.
019	PSA	124	002	Sɛ anka Awurade nni yɛn afa ɛberɛ a nnipa to hyɛɛ yɛn so,
019	PSA	124	003	ɛberɛ a wɔn abufuo sɔree tiaa yɛn a, anka wɔmenee yɛn anikann;
019	PSA	124	004	anka nsuyire no bu faa yɛn so, anka ɔhweam no twee yɛn kɔeɛ,
019	PSA	124	005	anka nsuo a ano yɛ den no afa yɛn kɔ.
019	PSA	124	006	Nkamfoɔ nka Awurade a wɔamma ho kwan amma wɔamfa wɔn se antete yɛn mu.
019	PSA	124	007	Yɛadwane sɛ anomaa afiri afirisumfoɔ afidie mu; afidie no mu abubu, ama yɛanya ɛkwan adwane.
019	PSA	124	008	Yɛn mmoa wɔ Awurade din mu, ɔsoro ne asase Yɛfoɔ no.
019	PSA	125	001	Ɔsoroforɔ dwom. Wɔn a wɔde wɔn ho to Awurade so no te sɛ Bepɔ Sion, a ɛnwosoɔ na ɛtim hɔ daa.
019	PSA	125	002	Sɛdeɛ mmepɔ atwa Yerusalem ho ahyia no, saa ara na Awurade atwa ne nkurɔfoɔ ho ahyia seesei ne daa.
019	PSA	125	003	Amumuyɛfoɔ ahempoma renka asase a wɔde ama teneneefoɔ so. Sɛ ɛba saa a, teneneefoɔ nam wɔn so bɛyɛ bɔne.
019	PSA	125	004	Ao Awurade, wɔn a wɔyɛ papa no, yɛ wɔn papa, wɔn a wɔtene wɔ akoma mu no, yɛ wɔn papa.
019	PSA	125	005	Na wɔn a wɔmane fa akwan kɔntɔnkye so no deɛ, Awurade bɛpamo wɔn ne nnebɔneyɛfoɔ. Asomdwoeɛ nka Israel.
019	PSA	126	001	Ɔsoroforɔ dwom. Ɛberɛ a Awurade de Sion firi nnommum sane baeɛ no, yɛyɛɛ sɛ nnipa a wɔasoso adaeɛ.
019	PSA	126	002	Sereɛ hyɛɛ yɛn anomu ma, anigyeɛ nnwom yɛɛ yɛn tɛkrɛma so ma. Na wɔkaa wɔ amanaman no mu sɛ, “Awurade ayɛ nneɛma akɛseɛ ama wɔn.”
019	PSA	126	003	Awurade ayɛ nneɛma akɛseɛ ama yɛn na anigyeɛ ahyɛ yɛn ma.
019	PSA	126	004	Ao Awurade, sane fa yɛn ahonya ma yɛn, te sɛ nsuwa nsuwa a ɛwɔ Negeb no.
019	PSA	126	005	Wɔn a wɔdua no nisuo mu no de anigyeɛ nnwom bɛtwa.
019	PSA	126	006	Deɛ ɔde osu firi adie na ɔsoa aba kɔdua no, ɔde anigyeɛ nnwom bɛsane aba a ɔso nnɔbaeɛ afiafi.
019	PSA	127	001	Ɔsoroforɔ dwom. Salomo deɛ. Sɛ Awurade ansi ɛdan no a, adansifoɔ no yɛ ho adwuma kwa. Sɛ Awurade ammɔ kuropɔn no ho ban a, awɛmfoɔ no wɛn kwa.
019	PSA	127	002	Ɔkwa ara na wosɔre anɔpahema na woyɛ adwumaden brɛ kɔsi anadwo, ansa na woanya wʼano aduane. Ɛyɛ kwa, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn a ɔdɔ wɔn no, ɔma wɔda.
019	PSA	127	003	Mmammarima yɛ agyapadeɛ a ɛfiri Awurade hɔ, na mma yɛ akatua a ɛfiri noɔ.
019	PSA	127	004	Mmammarima a wɔwo wɔn mmeranteberɛ mu no te sɛ agyan a ɛhyɛ ɔsraani nsam.
019	PSA	127	005	Nhyira ne onipa a nʼagyan kotokuo ayɛ ma. Wɔn anim rengu ase ɛberɛ a wɔahyia wɔn atamfoɔ wɔ kuro ɛpono ano.
019	PSA	128	001	Ɔsorokorɔ dwom. Nhyira ne wɔn a wɔsuro Awurade, na wɔnante nʼakwan so.
019	PSA	128	002	Wobɛdi wʼadwuma so aba; nhyira ne yiedie bɛyɛ wo dea.
019	PSA	128	003	Wo yere bɛyɛ sɛ bobe a ɛso aba wɔ wo fie; na wo mmammarima ayɛ sɛ ngo dua a afifiri atwa wo ɛpono ho ahyia.
019	PSA	128	004	Yei ne onipa a wɔahyira noɔ, deɛ ɔsuro Awurade no.
019	PSA	128	005	Awurade nhyira wo mfiri Sion wo nkwa nna nyinaa; na ɔmma wo nhunu Yerusalem nkɔsoɔ,
019	PSA	128	006	na ɔmma wo ntena ase nhunu wo mma mma. Asomdwoeɛ nka Israel.
019	PSA	129	001	Ɔsoroforɔ dwom. “Wɔahyɛ me so pii firi me mmɔfraase, ma Israel nka.
019	PSA	129	002	“Wɔahyɛ me so pii firi me mmɔfraase, nanso wɔntumi nnii me so nkonim.
019	PSA	129	003	Fentemfoɔ afentem mʼakyi ayɛ wɔn nkofie atentene.
019	PSA	129	004	Nanso Awurade yɛ ɔteneneeni; Watwitwa amumuyɛfoɔ nhoma afiri me ho.”
019	PSA	129	005	Ma wɔn a wɔtan Sion nyinaa mfa animguaseɛ nsane wɔn akyi.
019	PSA	129	006	Ma wɔnyɛ sɛ ɛserɛ a ɛwɔ ɔdan atifi, ɛnnyini na ahye;
019	PSA	129	007	Ɛremma otwafoɔ nya biribi wɔ ne nsam, na deɛ ɔboaboa ano nso renya hwee nʼabasa so.
019	PSA	129	008	Mma wɔn a wɔtwam hɔ nnka sɛ, “Awurade nhyira mmra mo so; yɛhyira mo wɔ Awurade din mu.”
019	PSA	130	001	Ɔsorokorɔ dwom. Ao Awurade, mefiri ebunu mu resu frɛ wo;
019	PSA	130	002	Ao Awurade tie me nne. Wɛn wʼaso ma me nkotosrɛ.
019	PSA	130	003	Ao Awurade, sɛ wobu yɛn bɔne ho nkonta a, anka hwan na ɔbɛtumi agyina ano?
019	PSA	130	004	Nanso, wowɔ bɔnefakyɛ; ɛno enti wɔsuro wo.
019	PSA	130	005	Metwɛn Awurade, me kra twɛn, na nʼasɛm mu na mede mʼanidasoɔ ahyɛ.
019	PSA	130	006	Me kra twɛne Awurade sene sɛdeɛ awɛmfoɔ twɛne adekyeɛ, sene sɛdeɛ awɛmfoɔ twene adekyeɛ.
019	PSA	130	007	Ao Israel, ma wʼani nna Awurade so, ɛfiri sɛ Awurade wɔ adɔeɛ a ɛwɔ hɔ daa na ɔgyeɛ amapa wɔ ne mu.
019	PSA	130	008	Ɔno ankasa bɛgye Israel afiri wɔn bɔne nyinaa mu.
019	PSA	131	001	Ɔsoroforɔ dwom. Dawid deɛ. Ao Awurade, ahomasoɔ nni mʼakoma mu, na mʼani ntraa ntɔn; memma nsɛm akɛseɛ nha me anaa nsɛm a ɛyɛ nwanwa dodo ma me.
019	PSA	131	002	Na mmom, mama me kra anya abotɔyam te sɛ akɔkoaa a ɔda ne maame so renum no, te sɛ akɔkoaa a ɔtua nufoɔ ano no, saa ara na me kra ayɛ wɔ me mu.
019	PSA	131	003	Ao Israel, ma wʼani nna Awurade so, seesei ne daa nyinaa.
019	PSA	132	001	Ɔsoroforɔ dwom. Ao Awurade kae Dawid ne ɔhaw ahodoɔ a ɔgyinaa ano no.
019	PSA	132	002	Ɔkaa Awurade ntam na ɔhyɛɛ Yakob Otumfoɔ no bɔ sɛ,
019	PSA	132	003	“Merenhyɛne me fie na merenkɔda me mpa so,
019	PSA	132	004	meremma nna mfa me na meremma mʼani nkum,
019	PSA	132	005	kɔsi sɛ menya baabi ama Awurade, baabi a Yakob Otumfoɔ no bɛtena.”
019	PSA	132	006	Yɛtee wɔ Efrata, yɛbɛtoo so wɔ Yaar mfuo so.
019	PSA	132	007	“Momma yɛnkɔ nʼatenaeɛ; momma yɛnsom wɔ ne nan ntiasoɔ hɔ.
019	PSA	132	008	‘Ao Awurade, sɔre bra wʼahomegyebea, wo ne wo tumi Adaka no.
019	PSA	132	009	Ma tenenee nyɛ sɛ ntadeɛ mma wʼasɔfoɔ; ma wʼahotefoɔ nto ahurisie dwom.’”
019	PSA	132	010	Wo ɔsomfoɔ Dawid enti, nyi wʼani mfiri deɛ woasra no ngo no so.
019	PSA	132	011	Awurade kaa ntam kyerɛɛ Dawid, nokorɛ ntam a ɔrentwe nsane sɛ, “Wʼasefoɔ no mu baako na mede no bɛtena wʼahennwa so.
019	PSA	132	012	Sɛ wo mmammarima di mʼapam so na wɔtie me nkyerɛkyerɛ a, ɛnneɛ wɔn mmammarima bɛtena wʼahennwa so afebɔɔ.”
019	PSA	132	013	Awurade ayi Sion, ɔde hɔ ayɛ nʼatenaeɛ:
019	PSA	132	014	“Ɛha ne mʼahomegyebea daa nyinaa; ɛha na mɛtena adi ɔhene, ɛfiri sɛ ɛha na mepɛ,
019	PSA	132	015	mede nneɛma pa bebree bɛhyira no na mama nʼahiafoɔ adidi amee.
