019	PSA	136	007	Ɔno na ɔbɔɔ nkanea akɛseɛ no. Nʼadɔeɛ wɔ hɔ daa.
019	PSA	136	008	Ɔbɔɔ owia sɛ ɛnni adekyeeɛ so. Nʼadɔeɛ wɔ hɔ daa.
