019	PSA	137	001	Babilonia nsubɔntene ho, ɛhɔ na yɛtena suiɛ ɛberɛ a yɛkaee Sion no.
019	PSA	137	002	Ɛhɔ nsukakye nnua so na yɛde yɛn asankuo sensɛneeɛ,
