023	ISA	024	016	Ɛfiri asase ano, yɛte nnwontoɔ sɛ, “Animuonyam nka Ɔteneneeni no.” Nanso mekaa sɛ, “Matɔ baha, mapa aba! Me nnue! Ɔfatwafoɔ redi hwammɔ! Ɔnam nnaadaa so redi hwammɔ.”
023	ISA	024	017	Ehu, amena ne afidie retwɛn mo, Ao nnipa a mote asase soɔ.
