024	JER	010	025	Hwie wʼabufuhyeɛ no gu amanaman a wɔnnye wo ntom no so, nnipa a wɔmmɔ wo din no so. Ɛfiri sɛ, wɔasɛe Yakob wɔasɛe no koraa na wɔasɛe nʼasase a wɔwoo no too so.
024	JER	011	001	Asɛm a ɛfiri Awurade hɔ baa Yeremia nkyɛn nie:
