041	MAR	015	037	Afei, Yesu de nne kɛseɛ teaam bio, na ɔgyaa ne honhom mu wuiɛ.
041	MAR	015	038	Ɛhɔ ara, ntoma a ɛtwa asɔredan no mu no mu suanee mmienu firi soro kɔsii fam.
041	MAR	015	039	Asraafoɔ ɔha so panin a na ɔgyina hɔ no hunuu ɛkwan a Yesu faa so wuiɛ no, ɔkaa sɛ, “Ampa ara, onipa yi yɛ Onyankopɔn Ba!”
041	MAR	015	040	Saa ɛberɛ no, na mmaa bi gyinagyina akyiri baabi rehwɛ deɛ ɛrekɔ so. Mmaa no bi ne Maria Magdalene, Maria a ɔyɛ Yakobo kumaa ne Yosef maame ne Salome.
041	MAR	015	041	Ɛberɛ a na Yesu wɔ Galilea no, saa mmaa yi dii nʼakyi somm no. Saa ara nso na na nnipa bi a wɔdii nʼakyi baa Yerusalem no bi nso wɔ hɔ.
041	MAR	015	042	Ɛduruu anwummerɛ no, ɛsiane sɛ na adeɛ kye a ɛyɛ Homeda no enti,
041	MAR	015	043	ɔbadwani animuonyamfoɔ bi a, wɔfrɛ no Yosef a ɔfiri Arimatea a, na ɔretwɛn ɛberɛ a Onyankopɔn Ahennie no bɛba no de akokoɔduru kɔɔ Pilato hɔ kɔsrɛɛ no sɛ, ɔmfa Yesu amu no mma no.
041	MAR	015	044	Ɛberɛ a Pilato tee sɛ Yesu awu no, wannye anni, enti ɔfrɛɛ Roma asraafoɔ panin a na ɔhwɛ hɔ no bisaa no.
