044	ACT	015	017	sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, nnipa a wɔaka no, ne amanamanmufoɔ a me din da wɔn so no bɛhwehwɛ Awurade.’
044	ACT	015	018	Awurade a ɔdaa yei adi ɛberɛ bi a atwam no, ɔno na ɔbɛyɛ yeinom nyinaa.”
044	ACT	015	019	Yakobo toaa so sɛ, “Mʼadwene ne sɛ, ɛnsɛ sɛ yɛha amanamanmufoɔ a wɔde wɔn ho rema Onyankopɔn no.
