044	ACT	021	019	Nkyea no akyi no, Paulo kaa biribiara a Onyankopɔn nam ne som no so ayɛ wɔ amanamanmufoɔ no mu no kyerɛɛ wɔn.
044	ACT	021	020	Wɔtiee Paulo amanneɛbɔ no wieeɛ no, wɔhyɛɛ Onyankopɔn animuonyam. Afei, wɔka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Onua, wʼankasa wodi adanseɛ sɛ Yudafoɔ mpempem na na wɔabɛyɛ asuafoɔ a wɔn nyinaa nso di yɛn mmara no so.
044	ACT	021	021	Saa nnipa yi ate sɛ wotia Mose mmara no ne Yudafoɔ amanneɛ; ɛne sɛ, wokyerɛkyerɛ Yudafoɔ a wɔte amanamanmufoɔ no mu sɛ wɔnntwa wɔn mma twetia na wɔnnni yɛn amanneɛ nso so.
044	ACT	021	022	Deɛ ɛbɛyɛ biara, wɔbɛte sɛ woaba ha. Enti, afei yɛbɛyɛ no ɛdeɛn?
044	ACT	021	023	Yɛ deɛ yɛrebɛka akyerɛ wo yi. Mmarima baanan bi wɔ yɛn nkyɛn ha a, wɔresiesie wɔn ho ama amanneɛ ho bɔhyɛ.
044	ACT	021	024	Wo ne wɔn nkɔ na monkɔdwira mo ho na tua ho ka ma wɔn sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, wɔbɛtumi atwitwa wɔn tirinwi. Yei bɛma obiara ahunu sɛ nsɛm a wɔte faa wo ho no mu biara nyɛ nokorɛ, ɛfiri sɛ, wʼankasa mpo, wodi Mose mmara no so.
044	ACT	021	025	Amanamanmufoɔ a wɔabɛyɛ asuafoɔ no de, yɛatwerɛ akɔma wɔn akyerɛ gyinaeɛ a yɛasi sɛ, wɔnnni aduane biara a wɔde abɔ afɔdeɛ ama abosom; wɔnnni mogya; wɔnnni aboa biara a wɔantwa ne mene ansa na ɔwuiɛ; na afei nso, wɔntwe wɔn ho mfiri adwamammɔ ho.”
044	ACT	021	026	Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Paulo ne mmarima no kɔdwiraa wɔn ho. Ɔne wɔn kɔɔ asɔredan mu kɔkyerɛɛ da a wɔbɛwie wɔn ahodwira no ne da a wɔbɛbɔ afɔdeɛ ama wɔn mmaako mmaako.
044	ACT	021	027	Nnanson no reyɛ atwam no, Yudafoɔ bi a wɔfiri Asia hunuu Paulo wɔ asɔredan mu hɔ, hwanyanee nnipa a wɔwɔ hɔ no nyinaa maa wɔkyeree Paulo.
044	ACT	021	028	Wɔteateaam sɛ, “Israel mmarima, monsɔre mmɛboa yɛn! Yei ne ɔbarima a baabiara a ɔbɛkɔ no ɔnam ne nkyerɛkyerɛ so tia Israelfoɔ, Mose mmara ne asɔredan yi. Mpo ɔde amanamanmufoɔ bi aba ha de agu Kronkronbea ha ho fi.”
044	ACT	021	029	Deɛ ɛma wɔkaa saa asɛm yi ne sɛ, na wɔahunu Paulo ne Efesoni Trofimo wɔ kurom hɔ, enti na wɔsusu sɛ Paulo de no akɔ asɔredan mu hɔ.
044	ACT	021	030	Wɔtee saa asɛm yi no, kuro mu no nyinaa bɔɔ twi, kɔkyeree Paulo, twee no firii asɔredan no mu hɔ. Ɛhɔ ara, wɔtotoo asɔredan no apono no nyinaa mu.
044	ACT	021	031	Ɛberɛ a ɛdɔm no pɛɛ sɛ wɔkum Paulo no, obi kɔka kyerɛɛ Roma asraafoɔ apem so safohene no sɛ, basabasa asi Yerusalem.
044	ACT	021	032	Amonom hɔ ara, ɔsafohene no ne asraafoɔ mpanin bi ne asraafoɔ bi de ahoɔherɛ kɔɔ baabi a dɔm no ahyia no. Ɛberɛ a nnipa no hunuu no ne asraafoɔ no no, wɔgyaee Paulo hweɛ.
044	ACT	021	033	Ɔsafohene no kɔsɔɔ Paulo mu, kyerɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn mmienu ngu no. Afei, ɔbisaa sɛ, “Hwan ne saa ɔbarima yi? Bɔne bɛn na wayɛ?”
044	ACT	021	034	Nnipa no ano antumi ankɔ bɛnkorɔ; ebinom ka sei a, na afoforɔ nso aka sei. Saa basabasa yi amma ɔsafohene no antumi anhunu asɛm pɔtee a asi. Ɛno enti, ɔhyɛɛ nʼasraafoɔ no sɛ wɔmfa Paulo nkɔ aban mu.
044	ACT	021	035	Wɔde Paulo duruu atwedeɛ no ano no, ɛdɔm no bɔ toaa no enti asraafoɔ no tam no kɔeɛ.
044	ACT	021	036	Ɛdɔm no tu dii wɔn akyi teateaam sɛ, “Monkum no!”
044	ACT	021	037	Wɔde Paulo rekɔ aban mu no, ɔbisaa ɔsafohene no sɛ, “Mesrɛ wo, mɛtumi maka asɛm bi makyerɛ wo anaa?” Ɔsafohene no nso bisaa no sɛ, “Enti, wote Hela kasa?
044	ACT	021	038	Ɛnyɛ wo ne Misraimni a da bi ɔhyɛɛ basabasayɛ ase dii mmarima awudifoɔ mpemnan anim kɔɔ ɛserɛ so no?”
044	ACT	021	039	Paulo buaa no sɛ, “Meyɛ Yudani a wɔwoo me wɔ Tarso; Kilikia kuro a agye din no mu onipa ne me. Mesrɛ wo, ma me ho ɛkwan na me ne nnipa no nkasa.”
044	ACT	021	040	Ɔsafohene no maa Paulo ɛkwan ma ɔgyinaa atwedeɛ no so nyamaa nnipa no. Wɔyɛɛ komm no, Paulo kasa kyerɛɛ wɔn wɔ Arameike kasa mu sɛ:
044	ACT	022	001	“Anuanom ne agyanom, montie mʼanoyie yi.”
044	ACT	022	002	Wɔtee sɛ ɔka Arameike no, wɔyɛɛ komm koraa. Paulo toaa so sɛ,
044	ACT	022	003	“Meyɛ Yudani a wɔwoo me wɔ Tarso a ɛwɔ Kilikia. Wɔtetee me wɔ Yerusalem wɔ Gamaliel nan ase. Mesuaa sɛdeɛ wɔdi Yudafoɔ mmara ne wɔn amanneɛ so pɛpɛɛpɛ. Mebɔɔ mmɔden sɛ biribiara a meyɛ no, mede bɛhyɛ Onyankopɔn animuonyam sɛdeɛ mo nyinaa nso reyɛ ɛnnɛ yi.
044	ACT	022	004	Metaa nnipa a wɔka ekuo a wɔfrɛ no Ɛkwan no ho no nyinaa ma wɔkunkumm wɔn. Mekyeree mmaa ne mmarima de wɔn guu afiase.
044	ACT	022	005	Ɔsɔfopanin ne agyinatufoɔ no nyinaa di me adanseɛ sɛ, asɛm a mereka yi yɛ nokorɛ. Wɔn nkyɛn mpo na megyee tumi nwoma sɛ mede rekɔma anuanom Yudafoɔ a wɔwɔ Damasko no. Saa nwoma no na anka mɛgyina so makyekyere nnipa a wɔdi Awurade asɛm so no agu wɔn nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn, de wɔn aba Yerusalem na wɔatwe wɔn aso.
044	ACT	022	006	“Owigyinaeɛ a mereyɛ maduru Damasko no, prɛko pɛ, hann bi twa faa me ho.
044	ACT	022	007	Metwa hwee fam, na metee nne bi a ɛrebisa me sɛ, ‘Saulo! Saulo! Adɛn enti na wotaa me?’
044	ACT	022	008	“Mebisaa sɛ, ‘Ɛyɛ wo hwan, Awurade?’ “Ɛnne no buaa me sɛ, ‘Ɛyɛ me Nasareni Yesu a wotaa me no.’
044	ACT	022	009	Nnipa a na wɔne me nam no hunuu hann no de, nanso wɔante nne a ɛkasa kyerɛɛ me no.
044	ACT	022	010	“Mebisaa sɛ, ‘Ɛdeɛn na menyɛ, Awurade?’ “Awurade ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, ‘Sɔre na kɔ Damasko, na ɛhɔ na mɛkyerɛ wo biribiara a mepɛ sɛ woyɛ.’
044	ACT	022	011	Hann no hyerɛn ano den maa mʼani firaeɛ enti nnipa a na me ne wɔn rekɔ no sosɔɔ me nsa de me kɔɔ Damasko.
044	ACT	022	012	“Na Onipa bi a wɔfrɛ no Anania a ɔdi Mose mmara so a na Yudafoɔ nyinaa di no ni no te Damasko hɔ.
044	ACT	022	013	Ɔbaa me nkyɛn bɛkaa sɛ, ‘Onua Saulo, hunu adeɛ bio!’
044	ACT	022	014	“Ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, ‘Yɛn nananom Onyankopɔn ayi wo sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wobɛyɛ nʼapɛdeɛ na woahunu ɔteneneeni no, na wobɛte nʼankasa ne nne sɛ ɛkasa kyerɛ wo.
044	ACT	022	015	Wobɛdi adanseɛ afa biribiara a woahunu na woate wɔ Awurade ho no akyerɛ nnipa nyinaa.
044	ACT	022	016	Afei, ɛdeɛn na woretwɛn bio? Sɔre na ma wɔmmɔ wo asu nhohoro wo bɔne wɔ Yesu din mu.’
044	ACT	022	017	“Mesane mekɔɔ Yerusalem na merebɔ mpaeɛ wɔ asɔredan mu no,
044	ACT	022	018	mehunuu Awurade wɔ anisoadehunu mu na ɔka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, ‘Yɛ ntɛm firi Yerusalem ha, ɛfiri sɛ, nnipa a wɔwɔ ha no rentie adanseɛ a wodi fa me ho no.’
044	ACT	022	019	“Mekaa sɛ, ‘Awurade, wɔn nyinaa nim pefee sɛ mekɔɔ hyiadan mu kɔkyekyeree asuafoɔ, boroo wɔn.
044	ACT	022	020	Saa ara nso na ɛberɛ a wɔkumm wo danseni Stefano no, na mewɔ hɔ bi. Mepenee ne kum no so, hwɛɛ awudifoɔ no ntoma so.’
044	ACT	022	021	“Awurade ka kyerɛɛ me sɛ, ‘Sɔre na kɔ, ɛfiri sɛ, mɛsoma wo akɔ akyirikyiri, amanamanmufoɔ nkyɛn!’”
044	ACT	022	022	Ɛberɛ a Paulo kaa sɛ wɔasoma no amanamanmufoɔ nkyɛn pɛ, ɛdɔm no hyɛɛ aseɛ teateaam denden sɛ, “Monkum no! Ɔmfata sɛ ɔtena ewiase!”
044	ACT	022	023	Nnipa no kɔɔ so teateaam, hugyaa wɔn ntoma, saa mfuturo, to petee ewiem.
044	ACT	022	024	Roma safohene no hyɛɛ sɛ wɔmfa Paulo nkɔ aban mu, nkɔbɔ no mmaa sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a ɔbɛka deɛ enti a nnipa no nyinaa mpɛ sɛ wɔtie nʼasɛm no.
044	ACT	022	025	Ɛberɛ a wɔkyekyeree no wieeɛ a wɔrebɛbɔ no mmaa no, Paulo bisaa ɔsraani panin a na ɔgyina hɔ no sɛ, “Mowɔ ho ɛkwan sɛ mobɔ Romani a wɔnnii nʼasɛm mmuu no fɔ no mmaa anaa?”
044	ACT	022	026	Ɛberɛ a ɔsraani panin no tee saa asɛm yi no, ɔkɔɔ ɔsafohene no nkyɛn kɔbisaa no sɛ, “Ɛdeɛn na wopɛ sɛ woyɛ yi? Onipa no yɛ Romani!”
044	ACT	022	027	Afei, ɔsafohene no kɔɔ Paulo nkyɛn kɔbisaa no sɛ, “Woyɛ Romani anaa?” Paulo buaa no sɛ, “Aane meyɛ Romani.”
044	ACT	022	028	Ɔsafohene no kaa sɛ, “Metuaa sika bebree na mede tɔɔ me Roma manbayɛ.” Paulo nso kaa sɛ, “Me de wɔwoo me sɛ Romani.”
044	ACT	022	029	Ntɛm ara, nnipa a na wɔrebɛbisa Paulo nsɛm no twee wɔn ho firii ne nkyɛn. Ɔsafohene no tee sɛ Paulo yɛ Romani no, ɔsuroeɛ sɛ wama wɔagu Paulo nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn.
044	ACT	022	030	Esiane sɛ na ɔsafohene no pɛ sɛ ɔhunu deɛ enti a Yudafoɔ no asɔre atia Paulo no enti, adeɛ kyeeɛ no, ɔhyɛ maa wɔyii Paulo firii nkɔnsɔnkɔnsɔn mu. Ɔmaa asɔfoɔ mpanin ne agyinatufoɔ no nyinaa hyiaeɛ. Afei, ɔde Paulo kɔeɛ sɛ wɔnhwehwɛ nʼasɛm no mu.
044	ACT	023	001	Paulo hwɛɛ agyinatufoɔ no dinn, kaa sɛ, “Anuanom, ahonim pa na mede mayɛ Onyankopɔn adwuma de abɛsi ɛnnɛ da yi.”
044	ACT	023	002	Anania a na ɔyɛ Ɔsɔfopanin no hyɛɛ nnipa a na wɔgyina Paulo ho no sɛ wɔmmɔ nʼano so.
044	ACT	023	003	Paulo ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Wo a wote sɛ ɔfasuo a wɔasra ho fitaa, Onyankopɔn bɛbɔ wo. Wote ha de mmara rebu me atɛn, nanso wobu mmara no so hyɛ sɛ wɔmmɔ me!”
044	ACT	023	004	Nnipa a na wɔgyina Paulo nkyɛn no bisaa no sɛ, “Sei na ɛsɛ sɛ wokasa kyerɛ Onyankopɔn sɔfopanin?”
044	ACT	023	005	Paulo buaa wɔn sɛ, “Anuanom, mennim sɛ ɔyɛ Ɔsɔfopanin. Atwerɛsɛm no ka sɛ, ‘Nka asɛmmɔne mfa wo ɔman panin ho.’”
044	ACT	023	006	Ɛberɛ a Paulo hunuu sɛ nnipa no bi yɛ Sadukifoɔ na ebi yɛ Farisifoɔ no, ɔteaam wɔ agyinatufoɔ no anim sɛ, “Me nuanom, meyɛ Farisini. Mʼawofoɔ yɛ Farisifoɔ. Gyidie a mewɔ wɔ awufosɔreɛ mu no enti na megyina ha ama wɔredi mʼasɛm yi.”
044	ACT	023	007	Asɛm a Paulo kaeɛ yi maa ntawantawa sii Farisifoɔ ne Sadukifoɔ no ntam maa wɔn mu kyɛɛ mmienu,
044	ACT	023	008	ɛfiri sɛ, na Sadukifoɔ no nnye owusɔreɛ, abɔfoɔ ne honhom nni. Nanso, Farisifoɔ no de, wɔgye saa nneɛma mmiɛnsa no di.
044	ACT	023	009	Nteateamu no kɔɔ so kɔsii sɛ Atwerɛsɛm no akyerɛkyerɛfoɔ no mu bi a wɔyɛ Farisifoɔ no sɔre gyinaa hɔ kaa sɛ, “Yɛnhunu bɔne biara a saa onipa yi ayɛ! Ebia honhom anaa ɔbɔfoɔ na ɔkasa kyerɛɛ no!”
044	ACT	023	010	Akasakasa no mu yɛɛ den maa ɔsafohene no suroeɛ sɛ anhwɛ a wɔbɛtete Paulo mu; ɛno enti, ɔhyɛɛ nʼasraafoɔ sɛ, wɔnkɔ nnipa no mu na wɔnkɔgye Paulo mfiri wɔn nsam mfa no nkɔ aban mu.
044	ACT	023	011	Anadwo no, Awurade bɛgyinaa Paulo nkyɛn ka kyerɛɛ no sɛ, “Nsuro! Sɛdeɛ woadi me ho adanseɛ wɔ Yerusalem ha no, saa ara nso na kɔdi me ho adanseɛ wɔ Roma.”
044	ACT	023	012	Adeɛ kyeeɛ no, Yudafoɔ bi hyia kaa ntam, dii nse sɛ wɔrennidi na wɔrennom nso kɔsi sɛ wɔbɛkum Paulo.
