045	ROM	016	005	Asafo a wɔhyia wɔ wɔn fie no nso, mekyea wɔn. Monkyea mʼadamfo pa Epaineto a ɔno ne onipa a ɔdii ɛkan gyee Kristo dii wɔ Asia mantam mu no mma me.
